<item><title>Djibouti proposes permanent secretariat for African official gazettes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-proposes-permanent-secretariat-for-african-a0f738/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/dj/djibouti-proposes-permanent-secretariat-for-african-a0f738/</guid><category>Djibouti</category><description>A forum is due to consider a cooperation charter, shared publication standards and a database for laws issued across the continent.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:37:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" length="31696" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/dj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
